{"title":"Rimeclaw Crusher","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 50 Rimeclaw that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"rime-barnacle\" title=\"Rime Barnacle - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/2aa6085abb38dae1d13f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rime Barnacle</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×3</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-561.0px,-75.6px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/1/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/1/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/2/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/2/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/3/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/3/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:0px\"><i style=\"left:561.0px;top:75.6px\"></i></div><figcaption>Plymouth Wharf</figcaption></figure><ul class=\